#: ../../adr/index.md:31
msgid "ADR documents"
msgstr "ADR 文档"

#: ../../adr/index.md:1 96f0c43ecd2b45118a1abe8566a63faf
msgid "Architecture Decision Records (ADR)"
msgstr "架构决策记录 (ADR)"

#: ../../adr/index.md:3 40f4f405c8234fcc999da6b3d9b4afa2
msgid ""
"This directory contains Architecture Decision Records (ADRs) documenting "
"significant architectural decisions made in this project."
msgstr "本目录存放架构决策记录 (ADR)，记录本项目中做出的重要架构决策。"

#: ../../adr/index.md:5 a5c3459a81bc4b93b98d1ea7233321b0
msgid "What is an ADR?"
msgstr "什么是 ADR？"

#: ../../adr/index.md:7 5b75648e69204b70826628616a957b2f
msgid ""
"An Architecture Decision Record (ADR) is a document that captures an "
"important architectural decision made along with its context and "
"consequences."
msgstr "架构决策记录 (ADR) 是一份文档，用于记录一项重要架构决策及其背景与后果。"

#: ../../adr/index.md:9 cef119d81b2249df9525e5b4c63f4223
msgid "ADR Format"
msgstr "ADR 格式"

#: ../../adr/index.md:11 45179b625b4248cf89b5d34dde59c1b1
msgid "Each ADR follows this structure:"
msgstr "每份 ADR 采用如下结构："

#: ../../adr/index.md:13 25273f9646804ffca59da698532d70d4
msgid "**Status**: Proposed, Accepted, Deprecated, or Superseded"
msgstr "**状态**：已提议、已接受、已废弃或已被取代"

#: ../../adr/index.md:14 1f0de17d2b75424f85f6b9d98ad13a60
msgid "**Context**: The circumstances and constraints"
msgstr "**背景**：当时的情形与约束"

#: ../../adr/index.md:15 26fbd0e579c64eb496888ad240648e03
msgid "**Decision**: What was decided"
msgstr "**决策**：最终决定了什么"

#: ../../adr/index.md:16 0f7c8393a4ed496eae4431727dd86094
msgid "**Alternatives**: Other options considered"
msgstr "**备选方案**：曾考虑过的其他选项"

#: ../../adr/index.md:17 5a8598a658334e78a714bda6b3e2f549
msgid ""
"**Consequences**: The results of the decision (positive, negative, neutral)"
msgstr "**后果**：该决策带来的结果（正面、负面、中性）"

#: ../../adr/index.md:19 6b4978bf8a344a669f4fa385181052bd
msgid "How to Create an ADR"
msgstr "如何创建 ADR"

#: ../../adr/index.md:21 b4565b462c804d17898c9669c619f719
msgid "Use the `/PKB-adr` command:"
msgstr "使用 `/PKB-adr` 命令："

#: ../../adr/index.md:27 489379fa19ab42fdb0c49c2542f7bfbe
msgid "ADR List"
msgstr "ADR 列表"

#: ../../adr/index.md:29 111291a2cc784491a7ec9fba708c4c98
msgid ""
"There are no numbered records yet (`adr/0001-*.md`). Create one with `/PKB-"
"adr \"title\"`, then add the new file to the toctree below (or restore a "
"`:glob:` entry `0*`)."
msgstr ""
"目前还没有编号记录（`adr/0001-*.md`）。用 `/PKB-adr \"title\"` 创建后，把新文件加入下面的 toctree（或恢复 "
"`:glob:` 条目 `0*`）。"

#: ../../adr/index.md:38 9b16accc10744fa9a86132eb0a703d21
msgid "Index by Status"
msgstr "按状态索引"

#: ../../adr/index.md:40 459f069c5e384efc8960766cc5fecb7c
msgid "Accepted"
msgstr "已接受"

#: ../../adr/index.md:44 a318781bb59041a39ed45d68d496245f
msgid "Proposed"
msgstr "已提议"

#: ../../adr/index.md:48 9ccdb0381f904a6c9cae0547038ea80a
msgid "Deprecated"
msgstr "已废弃"

#: ../../adr/index.md:52 ce143aa0db66461b973aea29429c8a1b
msgid "References"
msgstr "参考资料"

#: ../../adr/index.md:54 f1b8712a633e4b51839943a34a86b50a
msgid "[ADR GitHub Organization](https://adr.github.io/)"
msgstr "[ADR GitHub 组织](https://adr.github.io/)"

